# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Big data lives in Google Drive, never in git. GitHub hard-rejects >100 MB and
# the OHRC ZIPs are ~750 MB. Folders are kept, contents are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each person's own path to the shared Drive folder. Six machines, six values.
# 01_HOW_WE_WORK_TOGETHER.md has always TOLD people this file is ignored; until
# now it was not, so the first person to commit theirs would have broken the
# other five and made a merge conflict out of the one file designed to differ.
data_path.txt

data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/pairs/*
!data/pairs/.gitkeep
demo_cache/*
!demo_cache/.gitkeep
weights/*
!weights/.gitkeep

*.IMG
*.img
*.tif
*.tiff
*.zip
*.JP2
*.mp4

# Large binaries that no rule covered: the ISRO instrument user guides (tens of
# MB) and the SIH .pptx template (~0.9 MB). Both belong in Drive, not in history.
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# Python
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/

lroc_coverage/

lroc_preview.png

data/lroc_analysis/M124545845LE_preview.png

data/lroc_analysis/M124545845LE_enhanced.png

# Raw range-fetched DEM windows (ops/fetch_lola_dem.py)
*.raw
*.npy
